# Normalize line endings to LF in the repo regardless of contributor OS.
#
# Without this, Windows checkouts with `core.autocrlf=true` (the default)
# rewrite text files to CRLF on disk, and every `git status` flags
# untouched files as modified. The 2026-06-07 audit caught .yml /
# .json / .svelte showing as "modified" with zero content delta — pure
# CRLF/LF noise from Windows checkouts. Pinning the canonical eol here
# closes that off permanently: future checkouts on any OS see LF, and
# `git status` only reports real edits.

* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary blobs that must NOT be eol-normalized.
*.png       binary
*.jpg       binary
*.jpeg      binary
*.gif       binary
*.ico       binary
*.psd       binary
*.woff      binary
*.woff2     binary
